==Strategy==
[[Wheel Cat (Rare Cat)|Chill Cat]] does well here when aided by [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] as well as meatshields, namely [[Pogo Cat (Rare Cat)|Jiangshi Cat]], [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Tank]] or [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Rover Cat Mk II]]. If the Aliens keep pushing through, bring a crowd controller such as [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Psychocat]] or [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway Cat]]. [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]] does well to snipe threats in all three chapters.

At this point, the [[Stellar Garnet]] can be unlocked. If not already obtained, and you happen to be struggling here, it is recommended that you collect it to keep tougher Starred Aliens down.

Don't forget to bring a [[:Category:Barrier Breaker Cats|Barrier Breaker]] for the UltraBaaBaa in Ch.2.

